    {
      "id": "decision:lazy-render-import",
      "type": "Decision",
      "label": "kg.render loads matplotlib only when something is rendered; parser defaults moved to kg.render.defaults",
      "description": "What: module-level __getattr__ in kg.render loads the renderers on first use; defaults the CLI parser needs live in kg.render.defaults.\nWhy: matplotlib cost ~0.35 s of every command, even kg query.\nWhere: src/kg/render/__init__.py, src/kg/render/defaults.py\nLearned: start-up 0.64 s -> 0.47 s, below RNF-06's 0.5 s target.",
