      "label": "Conclude kg as a code-graph tool for agents and publish the negative result (option 1); v0.3 not pursued",
      "description": "What: stop the code layer, publish docs/report.md (method, 7 strategies, small repos, stale graph, scrapy, step 0, lean control, limits, open idea of dotted-path string edges) and a reusable harness; README/roadmap/site say concluded; open v0.3 issues closed as not planned; milestones v0.1 and v0.3 closed.\nWhy: step-0 gate failed on time and the graph never improved accuracy; a negative result with checked references, seven strategies and a reusable harness is the one output with guaranteed value (most published numbers come from vendors).\nWhere: docs/report.md, docs/roadmap.md 'How v0.3 ended', README.md, docs/index.html, bench/README.md 'Measure your own tool'\nLearned: option 3 (bring string-reference edges to another tool) was left as an optional open idea; README's Why no longer claims the graph beats grep.",
